Go - net/http + http2: 
- transport config: &http.Transport{MaxConnsPerHost: 32, MaxIdleConns: 64, IdleConnTimeout: 90s, DisableKeepAlives:false, TLSHandshakeTimeout:2s, ExpectContinueTimeout:1s} 
- defaults: per-call context with 60s deadline, per-attempt 20s, dialer Timeout 2s, keepalive period 30s
- streaming: use io.Reader with buffered channel for chunk handling, reconnect with single immediate retry then exponential backoff; ensure http2 connection reuse by avoiding per-request DialContext calls
Snippet: tr := &http.Transport{MaxIdleConns:64, IdleConnTimeout:90*time.Second, TLSHandshakeTimeout:2*time.Second}; client := &http.Client{Transport:tr, Timeout:60*time.Second}
